<title>NETHERLANDS: ERIKS PROVISIONAL 1996 NET DFL 22.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>ERIKS PROVISIONAL 1996 NET DFL 22.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996 to Dec 31</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	    12.52 vs  13.05 </p>
<p>    Net profit			    22.3  vs  23.2 </p>
<p>    Turnover			     453.3  vs  427.8</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    33.6  vs  35.8 </p>
<p>    Interest income			0.8  vs   1.9</p>
<p>    Tax				     11.8  vs  14.0 </p>
<p>    Minorities charge		    0.3  vs   0.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Industrial components wholesaler Eriks Holding NV</p>
<p>said it would publish final results on March 24.</p>
<p>The company had said in August last year it expected 1996</p>
<p>turnover to be above 1995's, while net profit from ordinary</p>
<p>operations was expected to at least equal to 1995's.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
